  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Sustainable Coral Triangle</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Sustainable Coral Triangle focuses on three key objectives:Strengthening governance and policy frameworks to ensure effective implementation of sustainable fisheries and climate adaptation policies across the Coral Triangle; Empowering communities and stakeholders by equipping local communities with the knowledge and tools needed to safeguard marine resources and become catalysts for coastal and marine conservation; Enhancing sustainable financing through investments in sustainable fisheries management, biodiversity conservation, and climate change adaptation</narrative>
  </description>
